    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "315 Montgomery Street\nSan Francisco\nSeptember 21, 1929\nIt. Col. Gerald C. Brandt\nCrissy\n• Field\nSan Francisco, California.\nMy dear Colonel Brandt:\nAs a result of the conference of our Committee a\nIew days ago, I an sending three copies of the joint\nreport of our Committee to you.\nI will ask that you and\nMr. Mouton sign each of these three copies and that you\nmail the original to Milo H. Kent, Chairman of the Airport\nCommittee of the Board of Supervisors,\nimmediately.\nhave already signed the three copies which I enclose to\nyou.\nThe other two copies are for you and Mr. Mouton.\nAs I will not be back from Europe until about\nDecember 10th,\nI am very anxious that the Airport Committee\nof the Board of Supervisors have our full report in their\nbecause it explains in detail,\nhands taken by our Advisory Cormittee.\nthe position consist-\nWith best regards and good wishes, I am\nSincerely,\n(Signed) BILI"
    ],
